msgstr ""
"Taħt “Niżżel font”, daħħal dak l-URL: l-istylesheet u l-fajls WOFF2 jinħażnu "
"ġo uploads/wm-zero-cdn/ b’indirizzi lokali."

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:337
